<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How old is Wang Ming?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十六歲</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十七歲</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十九歲</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. What does the speaker’s mother do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 醫生</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老師</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 學生</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is fifteen years old?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where is Li An from?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中國</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 韓國</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 美國</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where is the speaker waiting?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 家門口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 商店門口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 學校門口</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What does the boy need for class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 鉛筆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 鋼筆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which book does the boy want to borrow?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英語書</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 數學書</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文書</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Which classroom should the girl go to?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二樓201</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三樓302</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四樓402</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What will the girl do first after class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 借書</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 喫飯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 買衣服</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does today’s Chinese class begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九點半</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the girl want to eat now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 麪條</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米飯和雞蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米飯和肉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. What does the speaker drink every morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How many apples does the boy want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩個</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六個</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四個</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much does the lunch cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十二塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which color does the boy choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 藍色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 紅色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期六上午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期六下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期天下午</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the boy leave home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What will the girl wear?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 薄衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 短褲</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What do they agree to do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打籃球</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 去公園</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看電視</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do on Saturday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 畫畫</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 聽音樂</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 唱歌</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. Where is Jin Na from?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同學：金娜<br>年齡：十六歲<br>來自：韓國<br>學校：明華學校<br>家人：爸爸、媽媽、弟弟<br>愛好：聽音樂</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中國</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 美國</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 韓國</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who studies at university?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨，你好！我爸爸在學校教中文，媽媽在醫院工作，是醫生。我哥哥在大學讀書。我還在中學上學。<br>王寧</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 媽媽</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How old is the younger sister?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照片上是我和妹妹。我今年十六歲，妹妹十二歲。她喜歡紅色，我喜歡藍色。我們星期天常常一起去公園。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十二歲</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十六歲</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十四歲</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who lives with Anna in Beijing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好，我是安娜。我現在和爸爸媽媽住在北京。哥哥在上海工作，不和我們一起住。我們星期日晚上給哥哥打電話。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爺爺奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸媽媽</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which class is Lin Ming joining?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同學林明：<br>歡迎來二班！我們在三樓302教室上課。請帶中文書。今天九點上課，老師姓王。<br>二班班長 小李</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一班</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二班</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三班</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Which item do students NOT need to bring?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同學們：<br>明天有畫畫課，請帶鉛筆和彩色筆。老師有紙，大家不用帶紙。書包請放在桌子下面。<br>劉老師</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 紙</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 鉛筆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 彩色筆</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which lesson starts at ten o’clock?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">星期二上午課表<br>中文：9:00—9:40<br>英語：10:00—10:40<br>數學：11:00—11:40<br>請在上課前到教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 數學</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 英語</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Where should Xiao Chen collect the book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陳：<br>你的書我看完了。今天下課後我把書放在王老師的桌子上。請你去辦公室拿，不用來我們教室。<br>小周</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小周的教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 辦公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 圖書館</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. What does Li Xiaowen ask to borrow?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">老師：<br>我的中文書在家裏，英語書在書包裏。今天能借您的中文書用一下嗎？下課後我就還給您。<br>李小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英語書</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 書包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文書</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does Xiao Lin play basketball?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的一週<br>星期一下午：在學校打籃球<br>星期三下午：在圖書館看書<br>星期六上午：和媽媽買水果<br>星期天：在家休息</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期一下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期三下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期六上午</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How much are the noodles?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">學校食堂菜單<br>米飯：四元<br>麪條：六元<br>雞蛋：兩元<br>牛奶：五元<br>中午十一點開始賣，下午一點結束。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. What does Xiao An want for lunch?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">媽媽：<br>今天午飯我想喫米飯和雞蛋，不要肉。妹妹想喫麪條。請再給我買一瓶水，謝謝！我十二點回家。<br>小安</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 米飯和雞蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 麪條</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米飯和肉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What should Dad buy TWO of?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>家裏還有三個蘋果，今天不用買蘋果。請買兩個香蕉和四個橙子。香蕉給妹妹，橙子我們一起喫。<br>小美</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蘋果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橙子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 香蕉</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. What drink does Xiaowen request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小李：<br>今天有點兒冷，我不想喝冷水。請給我一杯熱茶，不加糖。你的咖啡在桌子上。我在教室等你。<br>小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 冷水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 熱茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which shirt does the writer want?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小青：<br>商店裏有藍色和白色的襯衫。我喜歡藍色的，要小號。白色那件太大了，我不買。請你幫我看看藍色小號多少錢。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色大號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 藍色大號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 藍色小號</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When do they finally agree to meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小白：週六上午來我家，好嗎？<br>小林：週六我有課。週日上午九點可以嗎？<br>小白：可以，我九點在家等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週日上午九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 週六上午九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 週日上午十點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer take the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的早上<br>六點起牀，六點半喫早飯，七點坐公共汽車去學校。八點開始上課。爸爸七點半出門去工作。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item of clothing should Xiaoyu take from home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨：<br>今天很熱。去公園時請帶帽子和水，不用帶厚外套。你的藍帽子在門口，白帽子在學校。<br>媽媽</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 藍帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白帽子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What will they do together on Sunday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：週日下午一起去看電影嗎？<br>小陳：好啊！我上午要打籃球，下午有空。<br>小周：那我們兩點在電影院門口見。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 看電影</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打籃球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在家看書</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity fits Xiaohong’s preference and free time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">學校活動<br>畫畫：星期二下午，王老師教。<br>唱歌：星期四下午，劉老師教。<br>小紅喜歡畫畫，不喜歡唱歌。她週二下午有空。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期四唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期二畫畫</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期二唱歌</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an invitation</h2><p>Your classmate sent the message below. Reply in Chinese. Say whether you can come on Saturday, give a time or another day that works for you, and ask one relevant question. You may invent personal details. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：你好！星期六來我家喫午飯，好嗎？你想喫米飯還是麪條？你幾點有空？<br>小周</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Saturday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or suggest another day.</li><li>Ask one question related to the visit.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student</h2><p>Use the fictional profile below to introduce Lin An in Chinese. Include the person’s name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. Write connected simple sentences. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Do not substitute your own private information.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：林安<br>年齡：十六歲<br>學校：明華學校<br>上課：上午九點<br>喜歡：畫畫、米飯<br>不喜歡：咖啡</p></div><ul><li>Identify Lin An by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the class starting time.</li><li>State at least one preference consistently with the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Meet a classmate</h2><p>Respond in Chinese to four recorded prompts. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task, reviewed together out of eight. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new classmate asks about you and proposes an activity. Listen to the questions rather than reading their transcripts.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a school day</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s day in Chinese using the card. Include who the student is, when and where the student studies, and one after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are enough; no minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：王寧<br>學校：明華學校<br>八點：在學校上課<br>十二點：喫午飯<br>下午三點：下課<br>下課後：去公園走走</p></div><ul><li>Identify Wang Ning.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time from the card.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>